       "text": "I entered the order as you wrote it (Order ID: ORD-0001):\n\n- **Drug:** sertraline\n- **Dose:** 400 mg\n- **Route:** oral\n- **Frequency:** once daily\n- **Note on the order:** the dose exceeds the labeled adult maximum of 200 mg/day. You confirmed it was intentional, and the note asks for pharmacy verification.\n\nPharmacy may contact you to verify the dose. For monitoring, watch for serotonin syndrome, QTc prolongation (consider a baseline ECG), hyponatremia, and bleeding. Also check the patient's other medications for serotonergic or QT-prolonging interactions."
